{"title": "Reflective Shell", "pageid": 4173, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Reflective_Shell", "categories": ["Class actions", "Bonus actions", "Cut Illithid Powers"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Reflective_Shell.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Reflective_Shell.webp/300px-Reflective_Shell.webp, /w/images/5/57/Reflective_Shell.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Reflective_Shell.webp/300px-Reflective_Shell.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Reflective_Shell.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Reflective Shell</b> is a bonus action that allows the wearer of <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress\" title=\"Viconia's Walking Fortress\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress\" title=\"Viconia's Walking Fortress\">Viconia's Walking Fortress</a> to briefly reflect all incoming projectiles.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nA protective shell envelops you. It reflects any projectiles targeted at you back to their point of origin.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_MAG_TheBulwark_ReflectiveShell</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MAG_TheBulwark_ReflectiveShell\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MAG_TheBulwark_ReflectiveShell\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Reflective_Shell\"> Condition: Reflective Shell </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reflective_Shell_(Condition)\" title=\"Reflective Shell (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reflective Shell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Reflective_Shell_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reflective_Shell_(Condition)\" title=\"Reflective Shell (Condition)\">Reflective Shell</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Projectiles targeted at this creature are reflected back to their point of origin.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress\" title=\"Viconia's Walking Fortress\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Viconia%27s_Walking_Fortress\" title=\"Viconia's Walking Fortress\">Viconia's Walking Fortress</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This action reflects any projectiles directly targeting the caster. These include ranged weapon attacks, throwing attacks, and many ranged spells. What is classified as a \"projectile\"<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> is not consistent and cannot be easily intuited, so refer to the below list:</li></ul>\n<details class=\"details--root wikicollapse\"><summary>Projectile attacks</summary>\n\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\" style=\"column-width: 18em; list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Splash\" title=\"Acid Splash\">Acid Splash</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Acidic_Regurgitation\" title=\"Acidic Regurgitation\">Acidic Regurgitation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Alchemist%27s_Fire_(action)\" title=\"Alchemist's Fire (action)\">Alchemist's Fire (action)</a></li>\n<l