rt Nova\">Stormheart Nova</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sublimation\" title=\"Sublimation\">Sublimation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Synaptic_Discharge\" title=\"Synaptic Discharge\">Synaptic Discharge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Synaptic_Discharge_(Us)\" title=\"Synaptic Discharge (Us)\">Synaptic Discharge (Us)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Targeting_Protocol:_Hellfire_Missiles\" title=\"Targeting Protocol: Hellfire Missiles\">Targeting Protocol: Hellfire Missiles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tempestuous_Magic:_Flight\" title=\"Tempestuous Magic: Flight\">Tempestuous Magic: Flight</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Throw_Stone\" title=\"Throw Stone\">Throw Stone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Throw_Stone_(Kobold)\" title=\"Throw Stone (Kobold)\">Throw Stone (Kobold)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Throw_Stone_(Ogre)\" title=\"Throw Stone (Ogre)\">Throw Stone (Ogre)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Timmask_Spores_(class_action)\" title=\"Timmask Spores (class action)\">Timmask Spores (class action)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Toss_a_Coin\" title=\"Toss a Coin\">Toss a Coin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Trip_Attack_(Ranged)\" title=\"Trip Attack (Ranged)\">Trip Attack (Ranged)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vacuum_Missile\" title=\"Vacuum Missile\">Vacuum Missile</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Witch_Bolt\" title=\"Witch Bolt\">Witch Bolt</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></details>\n<ul><li>Area of effect projectiles like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Splash\" title=\"Acid Splash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Acid_Splash_Icon.webp/20px-Acid_Splash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Acid_Splash_Icon.webp/30px-Acid_Splash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Acid_Splash_Icon.webp/40px-Acid_Splash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid Splash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Acid_Splash_Icon.webp/20px-Acid_Splash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Acid_Splash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Splash\" title=\"Acid Splash\">Acid Splash</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fireball\" title=\"Fireball\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/20px-Fireball_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/30px-Fireball_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/40px-Fireball_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fireball\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/20px-Fireball_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fireball\" title=\"Fireball\">Fireball</a> can be reflected, but only if they are directly aimed at the caster. If the Reflective Shell caster is merely caught inside the explosion radius, the projectile will not be reflected.</li>\n<li>If the original projectile requires an attack roll, the creature who fired it must make an attack roll against themselves. This is always made at <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a>.</li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Early_Access\" title=\"Early Access\">Early Access</a>, this ability was a <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizard</a>-specific <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid Power\">Illithid Power</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Footnotes\">Footnotes</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Any action whose <code>SpellType</code> is <code>Projectile</code> are classified as \"projectiles\" for this and similar effects. These actions have a <code>Projectile_</code> prefix in their UIDs. <